.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt DF 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm df
.Nd display filesystem statistics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility requests the root filesystem's
.Dv STATFS
record and prints the total, used and available space in 1 KiB blocks, the used percentage and
the mount point.
.Pp
The current K60
.Dv STATFS
call has no path argument, so only the root mount is reported.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr stat 1
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
